      "timezoneId": 1,
      "title": "Co-Founder Circle  2nd Edition",
      "description": "<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>FINDING THE RIGHT CO-FOUNDER STARTS WITH THE RIGHT CONVERSATION.</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Finding the right co-founder is one of the most important decisions for any startup.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Co-Founder Circle</strong> is a safe and open space for founders, builders and aspiring entrepreneurs to meet potential co-founders, explore complementary skills, exchange ideas and discover meaningful partnerships — without pressure, pitching or sales.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Come with an open mind. Share what you're building. Meet people who may complement your journey.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Special Guest</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Praveen Dorna, Founder of Founders First Network</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><em>Startup Practitioner • Visiting Professor • Idea-to-Launch Specialist</em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Praveen Dorna is the Founder of Founders First Network, a startup practitioner, Visiting Professor, and former Director, Product &amp; Growth at PublicVibe (VerSe Innovation), with <strong>18+ years of experience across startups, product growth, and founder ecosystems.</strong></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Circle Flow</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>11:00 – 11:10 AM</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Welcome &amp; Icebreaker: </strong>Let's get the conversation started.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>11:10 – 11:30 AM</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Meet the Circle : </strong>Who are you? What are you building? What stage are you at? What are you looking for?</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>11:30 AM – 12:00 PM</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Founder Journey Conversation with Praveen Dorna</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>12:00 – 12:20 PM</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Where Are You Stuck + What Do You Need in a Co-Founder?</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>12:20 – 12:45 PM : Co-Founder Connections</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Connect 1-on-1, explore common interests and see if there is a potential fit.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>12:45 – 12:55 PM : Open Networking &amp; Idea Exchange</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>12:55 – 1:00 PM : Group Photo &amp; Wrap-Up</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">-----------------------------------------------</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Founders who want clarity on where they stand, what needs attention, and what to focus on next can opt for a Free FFN Diagnostic report from Founders First Network after the event</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>----------------------------------------------</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">For More Details WhatsApp @ 9985032005 - CHAKRI</span></p>",
