      "timezoneId": 1,
      "title": "Run for Child Health 2026",
      "description": "<h3 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\"><strong>Every Step You Take Can Save a Child's Life</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\">Join us for<strong> Run for Child Health 2026</strong>, a charity fundraising run organized by <strong>SAHARA Health &amp; Development Society</strong>. This event is more than just a run—it's an opportunity to bring hope, healing, and a healthier future to children who urgently need life-saving medical care.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\">Through your participation, you will help raise funds for children requiring critical surgeries, organ transplants, rehabilitation, and specialized treatments. Every registration contributes directly towards giving these children a second chance at life.</span></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\">About SAHARA Health &amp; Development Society</span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\"><strong>SAHARA Health &amp; Development Society</strong> is a non-profit organization committed to supporting economically disadvantaged patients by providing access to quality healthcare and rehabilitation services. Through its <strong>ASIDAR (Assistance for Surgical Intervention and Disability Assistance by Rehabilitation)</strong> initiative, SAHARA works closely with hospitals, doctors, donors, and government schemes to ensure that financial hardship never becomes a barrier to life-saving treatment.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\">Together, we strive to restore hope, improve lives, and create healthier communities.</span></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\">Event Details</span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\"><strong>📅 Date:</strong> Sunday, 4th October 2026</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\"><strong>📍 Venue:</strong> Gachibowli Stadium, Hyderabad</span></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\">Run Categories</span></h3>\n<ul style=\"text-align:justify\">\n<li style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\">🏃 10K Timed Run</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\">🏃 5K Timed Run</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\">🏃 3K Fun Run</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\">Participant Benefits</span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\">Every registered participant will receive:</span></p>\n<ul style=\"text-align:justify\">\n<li style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\">✔️ Official Event T-Shirt</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\">✔️ Finisher Medal</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\">✔️ Digital Timing Certificate (10K &amp; 5K)</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\">✔️ Participation Certificate (3K)</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\">✔️ Refreshments</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\">✔️ Hydration Support</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\">✔️ Zumba Warm-up Session</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\">✔️ Medical Support</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\">✔️ Professional Event Photography</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\">✔️ Well-marked Route &amp; On-course Support</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\">Why You Should Join</span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\">Every stride you take helps provide hope to children fighting life-threatening illnesses. By participating in this charity run, you become a part of a compassionate community dedicated to making healthcare accessible for children who need it the most.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\">Run with purpose. Run with compassion. Together, we can give every child the chance to live, grow, and dream.</span></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\"><strong>Your Participation. Our Mission. Their Second Chance at Life</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino;font-size:18px\"><strong>Note: In the event of inclement weather, unforeseen circumstances, or any major incidents that pose a threat on the day of the event, the organizers retain the authority to reschedule the Event. Please note that no refunds will be provided in the event of such circumstances. Thank you for your understanding and cooperation.</strong></span></p>",
