      "startDateTime": "2026-09-26T03:30:00.000Z",
      "endDateTime": "2026-09-26T12:30:00.000Z",
      "timezoneId": 1,
      "title": "ISACA Hyderabad Chapter Annual Conference 2026 - Fusion 2026",
      "description": "<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">ISACA Hyderabad Chapter proudly presents <strong>Fusion 2026</strong>, our flagship Annual Conference marking 26 remarkable years of driving excellence in IT governance, risk, cybersecurity, and audit in the region.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">This year's theme — <em>Think AI. Manage Risk. Prepare for Quantum.</em> — brings together the three forces reshaping the digital risk landscape. As artificial intelligence transforms business operations, as risk management evolves to meet new-age threats, and as quantum computing looms on the horizon, professionals across IT audit, security, governance, and compliance must stay ahead of the curve.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Join industry leaders, practitioners, and thought leaders for a full day of insightful sessions, panel discussions, and networking designed to equip you with the knowledge and connections to navigate what's next.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>Event Highlights:</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1\">\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Expert-led sessions on AI governance, cybersecurity, and quantum readiness</li>\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Panel discussions with industry leaders and practitioners</li>\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Networking opportunities with IT audit, risk, and security professionals</li>\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Celebrating 26 years of ISACA Hyderabad Chapter's community impact</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>Who Should Attend:</strong><br />IT Auditors, Cybersecurity Professionals, Risk &amp; Compliance Officers, IT Governance Practitioners, CISOs, Students, and anyone interested in the future of AI, risk, and quantum technology.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>Date:</strong> 26 September, 2026<br /><strong>Time:</strong> 09:00 AM – 06:00 PM IST<br /><strong>Venue:</strong> The Address – Conventions &amp; Exhibitions, Survey No 505, 506, Vyas Nagar Rd, Aditya KLC, Manchirevula, Narsingi, Hyderabad</p>",
